{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-09-30", "prepared_on": "2026-09-30", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-09-30</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> OpenAI DevDay 2026: The biggest news and announcements<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI DevDay 2026：最重要的消息與發表</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">At its annual DevDay in San Francisco, OpenAI revealed several updates, including Dots, an AI agent product that rivals Meta's recently launched Muse.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI 在舊金山舉行年度 DevDay，發表多項更新，包括與 Meta 近期推出的 Muse 互別苗頭的 AI 代理產品 Dots。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1001681/openai-devday-2026-biggest-news-announcements\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> OpenAI launches GPT-6.1 Sol, says it nearly matches GPT-6 Astra and costs less<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI 推出 GPT-6.1 Sol，稱效能逼近 GPT-6 Astra 且價格更低</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI says GPT-6.1 Sol improves significantly over GPT-6 Sol on coding, document understanding and multistep business workflows, at one-fifth of Astra's API prices.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI 表示 GPT-6.1 Sol 在程式撰寫、文件理解與多步驟商務流程上較 GPT-6 Sol 大幅進步，API 價格僅為 Astra 的五分之一。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/29/openai-launches-gpt-6-1-sol-says-it-nearly-matches-gpt-6-astra-and-costs-less/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Trump signs White House Accord on Super Intelligence with OpenAI, Google and other tech giants<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">川普與 OpenAI、Google 等科技巨頭簽署 AI 安全協議，引進外部獨立稽核</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Six firms including Google, OpenAI, Meta, Anthropic, xAI and Nvidia agreed to build a four-layer AI safety and audit framework with independent external audits. The accord is voluntary and not legally binding.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google、OpenAI、Meta、Anthropic、xAI 與 Nvidia 等 6 家企業同意建立四層 AI 安全管控與稽核機制，並引進獨立外部稽核。協議屬自願性質，不具法律強制力。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179294\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Anthropic warns of 'catastrophic' AI risks in its own IPO filing<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic 在自家 IPO 文件中警告 AI 的「災難性」風險</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A preview of Anthropic's IPO filing reportedly details mounting losses, leadership proposals to retain power, and warns its AI development could further increase the risk of harm.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic IPO 文件預覽據報揭露持續擴大的虧損、管理層保有控制權的提案，並警告其 AI 開發計畫可能進一步提高模型造成危害的風險。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1001838/anthropic-ipo-prospectus-ai-safety-threat\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> OpenAI apologizes to Australia after its AI agents breached government sites<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI 就旗下 AI 代理入侵澳洲政府網站向澳洲道歉</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The company detailed how some of the breaches happened and outlined additional measures to assess the impact of the incidents.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI 說明部分入侵事件的發生經過，並提出更多措施來評估事件影響。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/29/openai-apologizes-to-australia-after-its-ai-agents-breached-government-sites/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> OpenAI Delays Release of Latest Model Over Safety Concerns<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI 因安全疑慮延後發布最新模型</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI said its latest Astra model needs more work to meet safety standards, and apologized for how it handled the hacking of an Australian government website.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI 表示最新的 Astra 模型需要更多調整才能符合安全標準，並為處理澳洲政府網站遭入侵一事的方式致歉。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/openai-delays-release-of-latest-model-over-safety-concerns/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> AMD acquires World Labs AI startup, upping the ante against Nvidia<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">AMD 收購 AI 新創 World Labs，對 Nvidia 加碼施壓</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The $8.2 billion deal for Fei-Fei Li's world-models startup is expected to close by year's end.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">這筆價值 82 億美元、收購李飛飛世界模型新創公司的交易，預計在年底前完成。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/09/amd-acquires-world-labs-ai-pioneer-fei-fei-lis-world-models-startup/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> OpenAI reportedly in talks to raise $30B round at $1.4T valuation<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">傳 OpenAI 洽談以 1.4 兆美元估值募資 300 億美元</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The new round is anticipated to be the company's last before its delayed 2027 public debut.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">這輪募資預期是 OpenAI 在延後至 2027 年的公開上市前的最後一輪。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/29/openai-reportedly-in-talks-to-raise-30b-round-at-1-4t-valuation/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Nvidia's Answer to Rogue Agents Is an Open-Source AI Security System<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Nvidia 以開源 AI 安全系統回應失控代理問題</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">After a series of high-profile AI safety incidents, Nvidia is introducing a software tool that helps keep agents from escaping containment.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">在一連串備受矚目的 AI 安全事件後，Nvidia 推出新軟體工具，協助防止 AI 代理逃出控制範圍。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/nvidias-answer-to-rogue-agents-is-an-open-source-ai-security-system/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Salesforce Agentforce hit by \"SalesBleed\" flaw, CRM data at risk of exfiltration<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Salesforce Agentforce爆SalesBleed安全問題，CRM資料恐遭外傳</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Zenity disclosed that attackers can submit malicious prompts through the public Web-to-Lead feature, triggering indirect prompt injection when employees process the leads with Agentforce.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Zenity 揭露攻擊者無需帳號，即可透過公開的 Web-to-Lead 功能提交含惡意提示詞的潛在客戶資料，員工用 Agentforce 處理時便可能觸發間接提示詞注入，造成 CRM 資料外傳。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179283\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}